The snake there appears and somehow it speaks, the snake.

cue0120828
00:02:08.760 --> 00:02:12.380
Now, how to handle a passage like this in the Bible?

cue0120829
00:02:13.640 --> 00:02:15.340
The different schools.

cue0120830
00:02:15.720 --> 00:02:25.720
Modern critics, they take, for instance, a passage such as, the snakes spoke in a very literal way.

cue0120831
00:02:25.720 --> 00:02:31.720
And therefore they say like this, you know, we are in handling with people who believe that the snake speaks.

cue0120832
00:02:31.720 --> 00:02:42.720
And if this, if these people believe that the snakes speak, well, then we have to make certain assumption upon the level of intelligence

cue0120833
00:02:42.720 --> 00:02:48.220
of a group of people who believe that the snake speaks.

cue0120834
00:02:49.860 --> 00:02:52.360
So that's one way to approach it.

cue0120835
00:02:53.340 --> 00:02:56.560
And, for instance, if you would take other passages

cue0120836
00:02:56.560 --> 00:03:00.420
in which you show a higher level of intelligence,

cue0120837
00:03:01.420 --> 00:03:04.920
then we'd say, yes, but here you have the snake speaks.

cue0120838
00:03:06.360 --> 00:03:08.660
And we take this and the snake speaks

cue0120839
00:03:08.660 --> 00:03:10.220
as a very important passage,

cue0120840
00:03:10.220 --> 00:03:17.000
passage as a kind of an anchor on which everything has to be somehow controlled and referred

cue0120841
00:03:17.000 --> 00:03:24.000
to the fact that the snake speaks. That's one approach which is very, very popular today.

cue0120842
00:03:24.000 --> 00:03:31.000
Now, I don't accept this approach. I don't know why I don't accept it, but not because

cue0120843
00:03:31.000 --> 00:03:41.000
not because I... because one of the most important things in writings like the Hebrew Scripture

cue0120844
00:03:41.000 --> 00:03:49.000
is that you realize that the writings has a multi-level meaning.

cue0120845
00:03:49.000 --> 00:03:54.000
What we're dealing with is a very kind of sophisticated type of writings

cue0120846
00:03:54.000 --> 00:04:11.260
in which a multiplicity, I mean, a real multiplicity of different scales and different ideas are projected. In other words, the reader of the Hebrew scripture was not homogeneous.

cue0120847
00:04:11.260 --> 00:04:17.260
And this is the problem when you're dealing with a non-homogeneous public.

cue0120848
00:04:17.260 --> 00:04:26.260
Any writer has to really express himself at the moral level kind of sense.

cue0120849
00:04:26.260 --> 00:04:32.260
Now because of this, it's a matter of choice. There's nothing more than a matter of choice.

cue0120850
00:04:32.260 --> 00:04:54.200
I choose to say no. The snake, here the speaking of the snake has to be taken in a more or less metaphorical or non-literal sense. Why do I say this? Because I take the majority of the verses in the scripture in which it shows me a kind of intelligence that transcends animal speaking.

cue0120851
00:04:54.200 --> 00:05:07.200
Moreover, take with you again the speaking of the snake. It is not important, it's not a speech, it's not the fact that the snake speaks, it's not crucial to the story itself.

cue0120852
00:05:07.200 --> 00:05:17.200
What is crucial to a story? The behavior of ʾAdam and Eve, the dialect between ʾAdam, Eve, and God. This is the crucial thing.

cue0120853
00:05:17.200 --> 00:05:23.900
the thing that the snake speaks is a total, totally, absolutely marginal element in the story.

cue0120854
00:05:23.900 --> 00:05:36.200
Suppose that the snake does not speak. It will not have changed in any way the thrust of the story.

cue0120855
00:05:36.200 --> 00:05:42.000
Otherwise, it's not an element that will out-reach the story at another level.

cue0120856
00:05:42.000 --> 00:05:46.640
So, this is a problem not only dealing when you read the Bible,

cue0120857
00:05:47.240 --> 00:05:50.400
but also when you read any kind of reader, a poet and so on.

cue0120858
00:05:50.440 --> 00:05:56.840
You have to make a kind of a decision what to take of that poet or writer as literal

cue0120859
