and what to take of that writer as suggestive.

cue0120860
00:06:02.620 --> 00:06:03.900
And this we do at any time.

cue0120861
00:06:04.220 --> 00:06:09.560
Now, somehow, when we come to the Bible, the people become very, very picky.

cue0120862
00:06:09.700 --> 00:06:11.340
They say, no, you have to make a decision.

cue0120863
00:06:12.000 --> 00:06:15.700
I don't believe that you have to make a decision. I think the decision is, as far as I'm concerned,

cue0120864
00:06:16.080 --> 00:06:22.040
to take certain things, you know, kind of metaphorically, suggestive, and others to take it in a more literal sense.

cue0120865
00:06:22.720 --> 00:06:26.720
Is it clear? I mean, do you understand what I'm trying to convey? Yes.

cue0120866
00:06:26.820 --> 00:06:30.920
Maybe first a question. What is the traditional view, then, about the writer?

cue0120867
