Alright, now, of course, traditionally we believe that there was only one author, and that's the author is God.

cue0120869
00:06:47.540 --> 00:06:50.920
And I tell you why we believe that this book is written by God.

cue0120870
00:06:50.980 --> 00:06:51.860
It's a very interesting thing.

cue0120871
00:06:52.740 --> 00:06:57.960
Because the Jews believed that all books were written by God.

cue0120872
00:06:58.180 --> 00:07:04.760
In other words, God is the one who moves the spirit of man and makes you right.

cue0120873
00:07:05.220 --> 00:07:05.520
You see?

cue0120874
00:07:05.520 --> 00:07:11.520
Now, what makes this book holy, people do not understand, is not the fact that it was written by God.

cue0120875
00:07:11.520 --> 00:07:15.520
No. They don't say every book was written by God.

cue0120876
